# Curated domestic resource hosts; default policy is chosen by the private Loon profile.
# Checked against MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat (meta/geo/geosite/bilibili.list),
# blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script (Loon ChinaMax/Alibaba/Tencent) and
# v2fly/domain-list-community (data/baidu, data/bootcdn).
# Do not add cloud-provider parent domains, IP networks or generic CDN keywords.
# Douyin/TikTok resources and Bilibili image families are protected by the compiler.
# Music, Tencent games, TikTok and Douyin rules must precede this list in Loon.

# Bilibili video / audio streams. Keep API, website, hdslb and biliimg images in China.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilivideo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilivideo.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilivideo.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,acgvideo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilicdn1.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilicdn2.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilicdn3.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilicdn4.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilicdn5.com
DOMAIN,upos-hz-mirrorakam.akamaized.net
# This exact host serves Bilibili web player JS/CSS; never use a hdslb suffix.
DOMAIN,s1.hdslb.com

# Alibaba / Taobao resource domains, excluding cloud service parent domains.
